ption":"Milestone for triaged issues that have not yet been scheduled for resolution.","creator":{"login":"IgorMinar","id":216296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjI5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar","html_url":"https://github.com/IgorMinar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":681,"closed_issues":22796,"state":"open","created_at":"2018-01-18T16:52:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T09:12:24Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":7,"created_at":"2020-08-18T18:19:53Z","updated_at":"2020-11-20T16:27:36Z","closed_at":"2020-10-20T10:37:45Z","assignee":{"login":"JiaLiPassion","id":1442575,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI1NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion","html_url":"https://github.com/JiaLiPassion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# 🐞 bug report\r\n\r\n### Affected Package\r\nThe issue is caused by package @angular/packages/zone.js\r\n\r\n### Is this a regression?\r\nYes, worked in 0.9.1\r\n\r\n### Description\r\nWhen loading modules using requireJS, the zone is lost.\r\n\r\n## 🔬 Minimal Reproduction\r\nThe following <body> in index.html, which should also include zone.js\r\n<pre><code>\r\n  <script src=\"zone.js\"></script>\r\n  <script src=\"../node_modules/requirejs/require.js\"></script>\r\n  <script>\r\n  function testOne () {\r\n    Zone.current.fork({name:'one-zone'})\r\n      .run(() => new Promise((resolve) => {\r\n        // load one.js\r\n        requirejs(['one'], (one) => {\r\n          one();\r\n          resolve(one);\r\n        });\r\n      }));\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  // bootstrap\r\n  Zone.current.fork({ name: 'main' }).run(testOne);\r\n  </script>\r\n</body>`\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\nthe entire contents of one.js, in the same folder of index.html\r\n<pre><code>\r\nconsole.log('outside module \"one\" : ' + window.Zone.current.name); \r\ndefine(() => {\r\n    console.log('module \"one\": ' + window.Zone.current.name); \r\n    return () => {\r\n        console.log('module \"one\" function: ' + window.Zone.current.name); \r\n    }\r\n});\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\nIn 0.10.X, all three console.logs report the name of the zone as the `<root>`, and not my `one-zone`.\r\n\r\nWith 0.9.1, I see the following:\r\n```\r\noutside module \"one\" : <root>\r\nmodule \"one\": one-zone\r\nmodule \"one\" function: one-zone\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 🌍  Your Environment\r\n\r\n**Angular Version:**\r\n<pre><code>\r\nangular: 10.1.0-next.6\r\nzone.js: 0.10.3\r\nrequirejs: 2.3.6\r\n</code></pre>\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"mblout","id":12033112,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDMzMTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12033112?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mblout","html_url":"https://github.com/mblout","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mblout/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mblout/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mblout/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mblout/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mblout/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mblout/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mblout/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mblout/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mblout/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/38516/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/38516/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}